{"id": "0f2e6f90e2464ba98d4bdbde20ec3010", "type": "episode_summary", "patient_id": "daniel_isherwood_001_erika", "therapist_id": "af0292af-d675-4601-a414-f6a1d2ca4df7", "session_id": "ce4f859c-a735-4bc9-a80c-5c26b6cf26dd", "text": "The patient, a 55-year-old man, is beginning therapy to address a long-standing \"destructive part\" of himself that he feels is at odds with his stable life. He expresses deep love and appreciation for his husband, Erik, and their 20-year marriage, which he describes as the most solid part of his life. His central worry is understanding how he can have this wonderful, stable relationship while also harboring a secret, chaotic side.", "topic_key": "Relationships::RomanticRelationships & SexualRelationships", "topic": {"intent": "topic_detection", "top": "Relationships", "sub": "RomanticRelationships & SexualRelationships", "score": 1.0}, "turn_range": [1, 5], "turn_count": 5, "emotion_label": "SEEKING", "emotion_intensity": 0.6300904327163239, "salience": 0.2, "created_at": "2026-03-11T17:13:45.213072+00:00", "schema_version": 1}
{"id": "25e2ce75a48f4fae883d9e67490931c0", "type": "episode_summary", "patient_id": "daniel_isherwood_001_erika", "therapist_id": "af0292af-d675-4601-a414-f6a1d2ca4df7", "session_id": "ce4f859c-a735-4bc9-a80c-5c26b6cf26dd", "text": "The patient presents a highly structured life, anchored by a successful career and a deeply solid marriage to Erik that he calls his \"solid ground.\" He feels a profound disconnect between this stable identity and an unspecified \"alien behavior,\" which causes him to feel unsafe when alone in his home. Unresolved questions remain around this behavior and a lingering ambivalence about the life path of not having children.", "topic_key": "Personal Background & Identity::EducationLevel & WorkHistory", "topic": {"intent": "topic_detection", "top": "Personal Background & Identity", "sub": "EducationLevel & WorkHistory", "score": 1.0}, "turn_range": [6, 10], "turn_count": 5, "emotion_label": "SEEKING", "emotion_intensity": 0.6359246795114909, "salience": 0.2, "created_at": "2026-03-11T17:17:21.765441+00:00", "schema_version": 1}
{"id": "7d263eff568f44dcb45145a712ca13a6", "type": "episode_summary", "patient_id": "daniel_isherwood_001_erika", "therapist_id": "af0292af-d675-4601-a414-f6a1d2ca4df7", "session_id": "ce4f859c-a735-4bc9-a80c-5c26b6cf26dd", "text": "The patient has consciously built a stable, predictable life, highlighted by his 18-year career, as a bulwark against chaos. Despite this \"straight-and-narrow\" exterior, he revealed a significant and long-standing internal struggle (\"destruction on the inside\") that he was not ready to face in a previous therapy attempt. The nature of this internal conflict, and why he feels ready to discuss it now, remains the central question to revisit.", "topic_key": "Mental & Emotional Life::MainSymptoms & EmotionalReactions", "topic": {"intent": "topic_detection", "top": "Mental & Emotional Life", "sub": "MainSymptoms & EmotionalReactions", "score": 1.0}, "turn_range": [11, 15], "turn_count": 5, "emotion_label": "FEAR", "emotion_intensity": 0.615371935127218, "salience": 0.2, "created_at": "2026-03-11T17:21:14.354729+00:00", "schema_version": 1}
{"id": "52ec370e7ecb4fafac60d36e9198815e", "type": "episode_summary", "patient_id": "daniel_isherwood_001_erika", "therapist_id": "af0292af-d675-4601-a414-f6a1d2ca4df7", "session_id": "ce4f859c-a735-4bc9-a80c-5c26b6cf26dd", "text": "The patient stated this is his first real attempt at therapy for this issue, confirming no history of medication, substance use, or support groups, which he has avoided due to intense shame and a desire for secrecy. He was initially hesitant but became more vulnerable, describing his primary distress not as a single trauma but as a chronic, exhausting cycle of behavioral \"episodes\" followed by profound self-disgust. Future sessions should gently explore the specifics of these episodes (which he hinted are related to overeating) and the powerful shame that keeps his struggle so isolated.", "topic_key": "Mental & Emotional Life::MainSymptoms & EmotionalReactions", "topic": {"intent": "topic_detection", "top": "Mental & Emotional Life", "sub": "MainSymptoms & EmotionalReactions", "score": 1.0}, "turn_range": [16, 20], "turn_count": 5, "emotion_label": "PANIC_GRIEF", "emotion_intensity": 0.6260332525687615, "salience": 0.2, "created_at": "2026-03-11T17:24:46.214077+00:00", "schema_version": 1}
{"id": "7611214fb90940c7a0deccb45274eb90", "type": "episode_summary", "patient_id": "daniel_isherwood_001_erika", "therapist_id": "af0292af-d675-4601-a414-f6a1d2ca4df7", "session_id": "ce4f859c-a735-4bc9-a80c-5c26b6cf26dd", "text": "The patient experiences a significant internal conflict between his public persona as a dependable, \"steady\" husband and colleague and a secret self whose actions feel opposite and uncontrollable. This discrepancy creates feelings of fraudulence and isolation, as he fears Erik\u2014his primary emotional anchor\u2014does not know the \"whole me.\" We need to explore the nature of these secret behaviors and the profound shame tied to this perceived inauthenticity in his marriage.", "topic_key": "Relationships::Friendships & SocialSupport", "topic": {"intent": "topic_detection", "top": "Relationships", "sub": "Friendships & SocialSupport", "score": 1.0}, "turn_range": [21, 25], "turn_count": 5, "emotion_label": "PANIC_GRIEF", "emotion_intensity": 0.6317200169216954, "salience": 0.2, "created_at": "2026-03-11T17:30:23.706877+00:00", "schema_version": 1}
